+R_CofBuildLightMap
+
+Cry of Fear: lightmaps as the original client builds them (client.dll FUN_1005a110). Its renderer uploads
+its own lightmaps, without the engine's gamma table, and the world pass multiplies them by the texture
+with GL_RGB_SCALE 2 (FUN_10061b40, mode 5 of FUN_10062c10):
+  layers 61/62/63 (ambient, diffuse, direction): curve( 2 * ( ambient + diffuse * z )) * 0.5,
+      z = layer63.b / 127 - 1 (flat path, FUN_10059660)
+  layer 61 alone: curve( layer61 ) (FUN_10059880)
